WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.960
What do you think I want to achieve with this study?

00:04.960 --> 00:15.880
You want to test out how games with AI chatbots can be implemented?

00:15.880 --> 00:20.560
What do you think of your LLM companion in the kitchen?

00:20.560 --> 00:27.380
It was a little bit confusing, but overall we managed to do something.

00:27.380 --> 00:31.140
It was interesting that it had a personality.

00:31.140 --> 00:35.260
Did you like using blocks to convey your insights to solve the puzzle?

00:35.260 --> 00:43.300
Yes, though I did not understand the mechanic at first.

00:43.300 --> 00:48.620
It was also a little bit difficult because I got more blocks than I needed and not all

00:48.620 --> 00:55.140
of them were really correct to be used.

00:55.140 --> 00:56.980
Did you like using the text chat to explain

00:56.980 --> 00:57.360
why the AI chatbots can be implemented?

00:57.360 --> 01:11.520
I liked that you could use three answers, like three typed answers, but I did not quite

01:11.520 --> 01:17.940
know what was odd and what was just part of AI stuff.

01:17.940 --> 01:20.160
Are you satisfied in your work with the chatbot?

01:20.160 --> 01:21.880
Why or why not?

01:21.880 --> 01:26.960
I am generally satisfied.

01:26.960 --> 01:29.760
And I did manage to do what I wanted to do.

01:29.760 --> 01:30.760
Thank you for watching.

01:30.760 --> 01:31.760
I will see you in the next video.

01:31.760 --> 01:31.860
Bye!

